WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.020
From this laptop to that phone, without uploading anything.

00:00:06.793 --> 00:00:09.510
Here's how sending files works on Markdrop.

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:15.030
Open markdrop.in/share, and drop files, or a whole folder.

00:00:15.469 --> 00:00:16.609
Any type, any size.

00:00:16.869 --> 00:00:18.229
Neither of you needs an account.

00:00:20.055 --> 00:00:23.155
Share the link, or let someone scan the QR code.

00:00:23.755 --> 00:00:26.135
Nothing leaves your device until someone opens it.

00:00:28.114 --> 00:00:32.374
The two devices connect directly, and the files stream across, encrypted.

00:00:33.014 --> 00:00:34.794
Our server only introduces them.

00:00:36.934 --> 00:00:41.014
When a network blocks a direct path, an encrypted relay forwards the bytes.

00:00:41.714 --> 00:00:44.774
It can't read them, and the page shows which route you're on.

00:00:46.827 --> 00:00:48.687
Up to ten people can join at once.

00:00:49.287 --> 00:00:49.967
Forgot something?

00:00:50.307 --> 00:00:53.247
Add more files, and everyone connected sees them.

00:00:55.149 --> 00:00:57.689
On a computer, each file saves as it arrives.

00:00:58.449 --> 00:01:01.629
On an iPhone, one tap saves them to Photos or Files.

00:01:04.026 --> 00:01:07.546
The files come from your tab, so keep it open while people download.

00:01:08.126 --> 00:01:10.186
End sharing, and the link stops working.

00:01:10.798 --> 00:01:13.078
What we record lists what we keep about a transfer.

00:01:13.578 --> 00:01:14.898
It never includes the files.

00:01:17.407 --> 00:01:20.687
Send a file now, at markdrop.in/share.

00:01:20.707 --> 00:01:21.807
No account needed.
